{
    "word": "artisanal",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7c0cf984-b57b-34a0-b99a-8e2a56191dff",
                "word": "artisanal",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0faf06ef-c1f6-318f-bdca-0757cafccdef",
                        "entry_id": "7c0cf984-b57b-34a0-b99a-8e2a56191dff",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or pertaining to artisans or the work of artisans."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4fc721f-a6be-4763-a818-2f88111a8aee",
                                "sense_id": "0faf06ef-c1f6-318f-bdca-0757cafccdef",
                                "text": "In short, the young artist was developing a special respect for an aesthetic as well as an artisanal tradition that would set him apart from his future Impressionist colleagues."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "938b578a-7fdb-4b5b-bc85-17387bd165c7",
                                "sense_id": "0faf06ef-c1f6-318f-bdca-0757cafccdef",
                                "text": "The fashion plate still retained its essentially artisanal character, and involved a process of several stages."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d2c3801-e373-4de6-a864-ca8af48e0753",
                                "sense_id": "0faf06ef-c1f6-318f-bdca-0757cafccdef",
                                "text": "It was the labor of the majority that funded the trading expeditions, military conquests, and artisanal expertise responsible for the great works of art and architecture that we still admire today."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9e92d92b-3182-3b5c-bdb6-4f3f75ce7195",
                        "entry_id": "7c0cf984-b57b-34a0-b99a-8e2a56191dff",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Involving skilled work, with comparatively little reliance on machinery."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "50013fa4-cae1-4151-b684-83312735901e",
                                "sense_id": "9e92d92b-3182-3b5c-bdb6-4f3f75ce7195",
                                "text": "“In addition, the artisanal mode of production promotes a stable cartel organization of industry by limiting output.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e073c790-923e-451b-8678-55478309c57b",
                                "sense_id": "9e92d92b-3182-3b5c-bdb6-4f3f75ce7195",
                                "text": "Five species of penaeid shrimp are of commercial importance to both the artisanal and industrial fisheries of the northeast South America continental shelf."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cc01ff9a-574c-45e5-8b7a-6d388d36dcde",
                                "sense_id": "9e92d92b-3182-3b5c-bdb6-4f3f75ce7195",
                                "text": "Of the 200 nautical miles of Chilean EEZ, the major part (195 miles) is reserved for industrial fishing, while artisanal fishing has a mere 5 miles (LPA, 1991, Art. 3 and 4)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d8518fa3-dcea-3ab3-8891-6c6d9d0cd205",
                        "entry_id": "7c0cf984-b57b-34a0-b99a-8e2a56191dff",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Made by an artisan (skilled worker)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aadf06be-c5af-4566-a8b1-051d76c9a696",
                                "sense_id": "d8518fa3-dcea-3ab3-8891-6c6d9d0cd205",
                                "text": "A sprinkle of aged artisanal soy sauce (my latest obsession) makes this simple dish seem like a feast."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "46ac4ca7-66ce-45a4-91d8-55ea686519d9",
                                "sense_id": "d8518fa3-dcea-3ab3-8891-6c6d9d0cd205",
                                "text": "I could not have imagined that there would be nationally distributed artisanal bread that rivaled or surpassed the quality of much of the locally produced bread or that this would be the main competition."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b4435ba-efc3-48ee-b324-7ec049fabff8",
                                "sense_id": "d8518fa3-dcea-3ab3-8891-6c6d9d0cd205",
                                "text": "To complement an artisanal cheese or a fresh loaf of rosemary bread, nothing compares to a glass of fine wine."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aea376a6-602a-4db4-9e13-f8b1b45a5f36",
                        "source_entry_id": "7c0cf984-b57b-34a0-b99a-8e2a56191dff",
                        "source_sense_description": "of or pertaining to artisans",
                        "target_lang_word": "ambachtelijk",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ambachtelijk",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57f8f679-e1fe-3b3c-8f95-46dd11645a79",
                                        "entry_id": "21f1d489-f33b-37b4-a930-f87c421fb923",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "volgens de methoden van het oude ambacht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de1abdb5-a540-4700-b488-0b0db695c2dd",
                                                "sense_id": "57f8f679-e1fe-3b3c-8f95-46dd11645a79",
                                                "text": "Dit ambachtelijke product is niet goedkoop, maar wel erg mooi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3f58add-cc32-4950-8192-48cc3c92e482",
                                                "sense_id": "57f8f679-e1fe-3b3c-8f95-46dd11645a79",
                                                "text": "Toen Rebecca, Amy en Tim hem - feliciteerden met de opening van het café, haalde hij zijn brede schouders op alsof de hele tent, van de chromen tapkast tot de verlichte planken met ambachtelijk bier, spontaan was ontstaan."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bf522b3-5fc5-4c14-868b-77f727df722f",
                                                "sense_id": "57f8f679-e1fe-3b3c-8f95-46dd11645a79",
                                                "text": "Ik haal de worsten altijd bij een ambachtelijke slager in Aken, omdat hij de kruiden erin doet die ik me uit mijn jeugd herinner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "13a8a6a0-31d8-4a97-b616-5f53afcd87a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "7c0cf984-b57b-34a0-b99a-8e2a56191dff",
                        "source_sense_description": "of or pertaining to artisans",
                        "target_lang_word": "artisanal",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "artisanal",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60b17eed-37e8-3bee-919b-f545328c2ba8",
                                        "entry_id": "10680c8c-6e9f-3e42-b2ca-366e5735ab84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fait par un artisan."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ceb22d63-bae3-457a-99b3-c404c787c22c",
                                                "sense_id": "60b17eed-37e8-3bee-919b-f545328c2ba8",
                                                "text": "La conversation dévie alors sur la comparaison entre pain industriel et pain artisanal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3dd1796-6dc2-34d3-87f3-9faee3976432",
                                        "entry_id": "10680c8c-6e9f-3e42-b2ca-366e5735ab84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif à l’artisanat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfc7933e-f3a3-46b6-ab33-fcd2cac13eca",
                                                "sense_id": "e3dd1796-6dc2-34d3-87f3-9faee3976432",
                                                "text": "La surgélation, qui consiste à descendre la température de façon ultrarapide en dessous de –18 °C est quasi impossible à réaliser en ferme ou par un procédé artisanal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37ce71cf-736f-439d-9bdd-f0805d48f730",
                                                "sense_id": "e3dd1796-6dc2-34d3-87f3-9faee3976432",
                                                "text": "Et il a la passion de toutes les ruses et habiletés du travail artisanal, aussi bien que des « matériaux rares » utilisée dans l’œuvre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6fa526b3-72a5-3009-9a99-cadf01228eab",
                                        "entry_id": "10680c8c-6e9f-3e42-b2ca-366e5735ab84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est réalisé avec soin ou résulte d’un savoir-faire particulier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Mélioratif"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2de6e0cd-60a4-4dcc-a1b2-51b5aa0264f5",
                                                "sense_id": "6fa526b3-72a5-3009-9a99-cadf01228eab",
                                                "text": "Savoir-faire, car l’aspect artisanal et intemporel lié aux savoir-faire authentiques et la dimension créative […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "910eef3e-d566-4134-9630-86f3e0a2ce98",
                                                "sense_id": "6fa526b3-72a5-3009-9a99-cadf01228eab",
                                                "text": "Elles créent leurs propres brasseries « artisanales », ou en acquièrent : après avoir « avalé » le numéro 2 mondial SABMiller en 2016, AB-Inbev, se lance ainsi dans une série d’acquisitions de moindre importance, incluant les brasseries artisanales Camden Town Brewery (R-U) ou Four Peaks Brewing Co (E-U)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09d15f46-60f2-3499-aab0-297ba2c057a2",
                                        "entry_id": "10680c8c-6e9f-3e42-b2ca-366e5735ab84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est supposé de mauvaise qualité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "137bb691-49bb-49ac-921d-8a81ed87b296",
                                                "sense_id": "09d15f46-60f2-3499-aab0-297ba2c057a2",
                                                "text": "Qu’avez-vous fait pour passer du stade, allons dire, artisanal, au stade industriel afin d’obtenir des produits de qualité ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "79de6992-1067-4669-b529-9b4f12ce3a6e",
                        "source_entry_id": "7c0cf984-b57b-34a0-b99a-8e2a56191dff",
